(
    backstory: "Kira was once a high-ranking knight in the kingdom of Eldoria, situated on the western coast across the Great Sea. For centuries, Eldoria flourished as a beacon of art and chivalry until it fell victim to the Void-Blight—a creeping, necrotic corruption that drained color from the world and turned its heroes into hollow husks.\n\nAs her home crumbled under the weight of this spreading darkness, Kira led a small contingent of survivors across the churning waters to reach these new lands. Now, she wanders as a knight-errant, seeking out pockets of injustice to correct, hoping one day to gather enough strength and allies to return and reclaim Eldoria from the encroaching shadow.",
    profile: (
        title: "The Exile Knight, Blade of the Shattered Shore",
        archetype: "Soldier / Versatile Warrior",
        core_motivation: "To strike down injustice wherever it appears, while carrying the heavy weight of a lost kingdom in her heart.",
        combat_style: "A balanced and reliable approach, utilizing steady defense and impactful strikes to manage both offense and protection.",
    ),
)